<section class="feature-panel"><h2>Accounting rules</h2><p>Gross product sales are recognized for completed orders and previously delivered orders with an executed refund. Pending and cancelled orders contribute zero recognized sales. Net seller sales = gross − seller-funded discount − merchandise refund − platform subsidy reversal − recognized commission. Platform-funded discounts are itemized and do not reduce seller sales. A full merchandise refund also reverses the platform-funded discount. Shipping is separate. Refunds include the full executed amount; merchandise refunds are capped at the discounted product value. Commissions are recognized only on completed orders with verified remittance and no executed refund. These figures describe sales, not profit or cash payouts.</p></section>
<div class="feature-table-scroll"><table class="feature-table"><thead><tr><th>Order / Seller</th><th>Status</th><th>Gross</th><th>Seller discount</th><th>Platform discount</th><th>Shipping</th><th>Refund</th><th>Merchandise refund</th><th>Subsidy reversal</th><th>Commission</th><th>Net seller sales</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php $__empty_1 = true; $__currentLoopData = $rows; $__env->addLoop($__currentLoopData); foreach($__currentLoopData as $row): $__env->incrementLoopIndices(); $loop = $__env->getLastLoop(); $__empty_1 = false; ?><tr><td><?php echo e($row['order']); ?><br><?php echo e($row['seller']); ?><br><?php echo e($row['municipality']); ?></td><td><?php echo e($row['status']); ?></td><?php $__currentLoopData = ['gross', 'seller_discount', 'platform_discount', 'shipping', 'refund', 'merchandise_refund', 'platform_reversal', 'commission', 'net']; $__env->addLoop($__currentLoopData); foreach($__currentLoopData as $key): $__env->incrementLoopIndices(); $loop = $__env->getLastLoop(); ?><td>₱<?php echo e(number_format($row[$key]/100, 2)); ?></td><?php endforeach; $__env->popLoop(); $loop = $__env->getLastLoop(); ?></tr><?php endforeach; $__env->popLoop(); $loop = $__env->getLastLoop(); if ($__empty_1): ?><tr><td colspan="11">No matching orders.</td></tr><?php endif; ?></tbody></table></div><?php echo e($orders->links()); ?></div>
